<title>BELGIUM: BROKER VERMEULEN RAEMDONCK'S BRUSSELS STOCK GUIDE.</title>
<headline>BROKER VERMEULEN RAEMDONCK'S BRUSSELS STOCK GUIDE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian brokerage Vermeulen</p>
<p>Raemdonck, a subsidiary of Banque Bruxelles Lambert (BBL), on Friday published the following guide to stocks on</p>
<p>the Brussels bourse.</p>
<p>COMPANY		1996 EEPS 1997 EEPS  RATING   PVS</p>
<p> Bekaert		712	1,100	hold    sell</p>
<p> CMB		    176	  178	buy     hold</p>
<p> Cofinimmo	    180	  220	hold    hold</p>
<p> Colruyt		634	  703	hold    hold</p>
<p> Deceuninck	   230	  304	hold    buy</p>
<p> Delhaize		90	  103	buy     buy</p>
<p> Dexia		  258	  284	hold    ---</p>
<p> Electrafina	  790	  290	hold    hold</p>
<p> GBL		    725	  468	buy     hold</p>
<p> Gevaert		165	  140	buy     hold</p>
<p> Petrofina	    688	  755	buy     buy</p>
<p> Quick		   79	   93	sell    sell</p>
<p> Solvay	     1,330	1,688	hold    hold</p>
<p> Tessenderlo	1,082	1,319	hold    buy</p>
<p> Union Miniere	 59	   83	hold    hold</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
